project (id, x, p, q, id)
└─ sort [__scope_1 asc]
   └─ project (__scope_0, __scope_1, __scope_2, __scope_3, __scope_4) (rows≈3 cost≈4.7K)
      └─ project (t.id, x, t.p, u.q, u.id) (rows≈3 cost≈4.6K)
         └─ join right [t.x = u.x] (rows≈3 cost≈4.5K)
            ├─ source t AS t (rows≈3 cost≈72)
            └─ source u AS u (rows≈3 cost≈72)
